# One section per request

- Work on the named section only. Change at most three visual items.
- Read only that component and its CSS. Make the smallest diff.
- Do not edit other sections, Hero media, `/menu`, or `/press`.
- Do not commit, push, or merge.
- Do not update the canvas or GitHub. Tick `docs/current/implementation-checklist.md` only when the user asked to track that section.

# Example

User: "Do the Header."

Edit `Header.tsx` and the header rules in `globals.css` only. Leave the Hero.
